 .mcb-trust-badge-label {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1A1A1A;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 0;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"mcb-trust\">\n  <p class=\"mcb-trust-titre\">🔒 Paiement sécurisé</p>\n  <div class=\"mcb-trust-steps\">\n    <div class=\"mcb-trust-step\">\n      <div class=\"mcb-trust-step-icon\">🛒</div>\n      <p class=\"mcb-trust-step-label\">Aujourd'hui</p>\n      <p class=\"mcb-trust-step-sub\">Commandé</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mcb-trust-step\">\n      <div class=\"mcb-trust-step-icon\">📦</div>\n      <p class=\"mcb-trust-step-label\">24–48h</p>\n      <p class=\"mcb-trust-step-sub\">Expédié</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mcb-trust-step\">\n      <div class=\"mcb-trust-step-icon\">🏠</div>\n      <p class=\"mcb-trust-step-label\">5–7 jours</p>\n      <p class=\"mcb-trust-step-sub\">Chez vous</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mcb-trust-badges\">\n    <div class=\"mcb-trust-badge\">\n      <div class=\"mcb-trust-badge-icon\">🚚</div>\n      <p class=\"mcb-trust-badge-label\">Livraison<br>offerte</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mcb-trust-badge\">\n      <div class=\"mcb-trust-badge-icon\">💬</div>\n      <p class=\"mcb-trust-badge-label\">SAV<br>réactif</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mcb-trust-badge\">\n      <div class=\"mcb-trust-badge-icon\">🔄</div>\n      <p class=\"mcb-trust-badge-label\">Satisfait ou remboursé<br>30 jours</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
